The Stihl Maxima 20 cordless leaf blower weighs only 1.99 lb. Its lightweight design makes it easy to use around your home and garden, but the stihl 20 cordless leaf blower delivers the power needed for large areas, such as a yard or driveway.
For the commercial operator, RedMax is easily the industry leader in terms of the selection and performance of power blowers. The EBZ7500 backpack blower is the top-performing backpack blower. It features a powerful brushless motor, a large output, and excellent durability.
